## Faz 4 — Polish & Growth

- [ ] Light mode
- [ ] Keyboard shortcuts (Cmd+K command bar, tab navigation)
- [ ] Onboarding flow — ilk giriş, watchlist kurulum
- [ ] Empty states — watchlist boş, henüz sohbet yok
